<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="53b9747">&lt;p&gt;
    It is possible for the Product Owner to reject all, or part, of the submitted work. So it is important to remember to:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Utilize the Product Owner&apos;s time wisely
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Review the work to be submitted multiple times, to confirm that all acceptance criteria and other threshold
        requirements are satisfied, prior to requesting review and sign-off
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="fea7f8e4"></attribute>
<attribute name="usageGuidance" nodeId="d4970bee"></attribute>
<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="194d49e2">Meet with the Product Owner to validate that the completed work, such as a user story or developed feature, satisfies the
criteria as defined in the definition of done and any applicable acceptance criteria.</attribute>
</Element>
